\par ADDTIONALLY... Only a person who is bankrunpt of moral sense that God would want humans to mix what is not mixable would approve this. So, please have some sense and do not approve this to be grown. It would show a lack of logic and would ind
icate a lack of understanding of the risks involved.  With the recent contamination of rice production and rice seed supply, it would take additional lack of sense to allow this to be grown anywhere.  It would cause me to openly question UDSA's role in ap
