\par I urge the USDA to deny this and all other applications for outdoor production of pharmaceutical and industrial food crops and to institute a ban on this practice altogether.
\par 
\par Ban GE
 food crops to keep dangerous drugs, reactive proteins, etc. out of the food supply for the sake of future generations.  I have a daughter and I believe in that the Great Law of the Iroquois Confederacy stated it very well:  "In our every deliberation, we
 must consider the impact of our decisions on the next seven generations."
\par 
\par Sincerely,
\par Julie Rodgers
\par 7406 NE 145TH PL
\par Kenmore, WA 98028
