\par I have many allergies, as well as asthma.  I work very hard to live in an environment that supports my health.  I DO NOT want to also have to worry about my food.  It's bad enough for me when there's a bad air quality day.  Don't endanger my health furthe
r by letting pharma or GMO pollens loose in the air.
\par 
\par "Pharma" and industrial food crops are likely to contaminate the food supply if grown outdoors--especially in tornado-prone Kansas, where winds could easily blow pharma rice seeds into neighboring fields
