\par 
\par I am writing to urge the U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) to deny the application by Ventria Bioscience to grow up to 3,200 acres of genetically engineered, drug-producing rice in Kansas.
\par 
\par Please do not allow this do go forward. The engindeered rice will eventually contaminate the food supply with unknow
 results. Even todays GM foods have spread unintentionally prompting lawsuits for "stealing" against innocent farmers. All the company profits in the world cannot justify the risk to our ecosystem. 
