ado-prone Kansas, where winds could easily blow pharma rice seeds into neighboring fields of corn, soybeans, or wheat, this risk is very high. Contamination poses potentially serious risks to human health and threatens farmers who may be held liable for c
ontamination. Experience shows that neither the USDA nor biotechnology companies can be trusted to prevent contamination.
