\par Secretary Mike Johanns
\par Secretary of Agriculture
\par U.S. Department of Agriculture
\par  
\par 
\par Subject: Keep Drugs Out of Our Food Supply!
\par 
\par 
\par Dear Secretary Johanns,
\par 
\par I am writing to urge the U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) to deny the application by Ventria Bioscience to grow up to 3,200 acres of genetically engineered, drug-producing rice in Kansas.
\par 
\par "Pharma" and industrial food crops are likely to contaminate the food supply if grown outdoors--especially in tornado-prone Kansas, where winds could easily blow pharma rice
 seeds into neighboring fields of corn, soybeans, or wheat. Contamination poses potentially serious risks to human health and threatens farmers who may be held liable for contamination. Experience shows that neither the USDA nor biotechnology companies ca
n be trusted to prevent contamination.
\par 
\par I urge the USDA to deny this and all other applications for outdoor production of pharmaceutical and industrial food crops and to institute a ban on this practice altogether.
\par 
\par Please do not be corrupt anymore. Please, for the health of your own children. Please, it's time for those of you in high places (and low places) to grow up and join the HUMAN race and act like responsible adults. 
\par 
\par I promise that I will gladdly join any large group of citizens in this country an
d sue the USDA in a massive class action lawsuit in order to force compliance of the PEOPLE's overwhelming desires, choices and needs. In order to remain normal healthy non-bioengineered human beings. There is no real need whatsoever to bioengineer ANYTHI
NG!
\par 
\par Stop messing with God's creation. Understand that you may not pay the long term affects of this USDA decision, but your children and grandchildren WILL pay for these indiscriminate and dangerous decisions more over. 
\par 
\par God will not save us from ourselve
s, that is why he gave us free will, freedom of choice. That's why so many human beings think that when they kill someone, that they truly do not have anyone to answer to. Because either they do not believe in acting like a decent human being, or they hav
e lost their sense of what it is to be a member of the human race.
\par 
\par Look at the killing squads in the Central American countries that our government and our military have been training for decades at the "School of the America's" in Georgia. Why has our gov
ernment been trying secretly to train these murderous killing squads of Central American countries' military personel just to terrorize peasants who are just trying to make a better life for themselves and their families?
\par 
\par Why are my illegally confiscated 
dollars being used to train these murderous hit squads? THis means that I am indirectly involved in the murder and secret dissapearnces of literally thousands of innocent man, women and children in Central and South America. 
\par 
\par All the past presidents for t
he last 40 plus years are responsible for these crimes against a class of people who cannot defend themselves against an Fascist and Imperialist Agenda set forth by the illuminati here in the united States and in other countries as well.
\par 
\par We are aware of t
he Bilderberg Conference and it's members. We aren't stupid. We have lists of these elitist families, leaders, CEO's, False Presidents, Dictators and criminal War Lords, Weapons Manufacturers, Pharmaceutical Manufacturers, Bio-Engineering Firms, Prison In
dustrial Complex Controllers and their Owners and Stock Holders, Private Contractors who Have "No-Bid" Contracts with the U.S. and Foreign Governments and so on.
\par 
\par Please, those of you in the USDA who have ANY power at all, please join the human race! Please act out of decent human conscience. Do the RIGHT thing. 
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par Sincerely,
\par Blaise Gauba
\par 4421 Pacific Coast Hwy.
\par Unit # E-107
\par Torrance, CA 90505-5684
\par 
