\par I've learned that "Pharma" and industrial food crops are likely to contaminate the food supply if grown outdoors--espec
ially in tornado-prone Kansas, where winds could easily blow pharma rice seeds into neighboring fields of corn, soybeans, or wheat. I find this to be unacceptable! From what I've learned, the ontamination will expose potentially serious risks to human hea
