\par }\pard \qr \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\insrsid7698630 March 8, 2007   4:43 PM}{\b\f36\fs32\insrsid7698630 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f36\insrsid7698630 
\par Secretary Mike Johanns
\par Secretary of Agriculture
\par U.S. Department of Agriculture
\par  
\par 
\par Subject: Keep Drugs Out of Our Food Supply!
\par 
\par 
\par Dear Secretary Johanns,
\par 
\par I am writing to urge the U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) to deny the application by Ventria Bioscience to grow up to 3,200 acres of genetically engineered, drug-producing rice in Kansas.
\par 
\par "Pharma" and industrial food crops are likely to contaminate the food supply if grown outdoors--especially in tornado-prone Kansas, where winds could easily blow pharma rice seeds into neighboring fields of corn, soybeans, or wheat. 
\par 
\par Contamination poses potentially serious risks to human health and threatens farmers who may be held liable for contamination. Experience shows that neither the USDA nor biotechnology companies can be trusted to prevent contamination.
\par 
\par How dare you?  How dare you do this to our crops!  Evolution is suppose to be a slow process to stop the possible contamination and changes that genes could do.  Remember Evolution, Darwin?  
\par 
\par How dare you allow the "Pharma" industry to do this to our food supply.  USDA is suppose to prote
ct the food and environment.  Why don't you do your job?  Are you getting paid off by the corporations?  Is a payoff more important that food safety for millions...about 135 million people?  
\par 
\par The Ecoli bacteria on spinach happened because the USDA does not look at the environment and how it is effected.  You do not study the ecological and biological balance.  Now you are trying to contaminate on a larger level?  How dare you?
\par 
\par I want NO genetically alterned food.  I want NO cloned food.  I want NO "Pharma
" drugs in food.  I want any such food on the market marked and labeled so I can avoid it like the plague.  Then I will NOT buy it!  Never!!!  I'll buy seeds and grow my own food before I'll eat this drug dealer food!
\par 
\par When will you realize that the "Pharm
a" industry is no different than a drug dealer or pusher on the street?  They make profits by making people sick.  Contaminating the food supply is a great way to make people sick.  Can you say ecoli spinach?  Maybe they didn't do it but people died becau
se of the Agri-corporation's food processing of cows that ecoli.
\par 
\par I urge the USDA to deny this and all other applications for outdoor production of pharmaceutical and industrial food crops and to institute a ban on this practice altogether.
\par 
\par Sincerely,
\par Sherry Lewis
\par POB 625
\par Woodstock, GA 30188
\par 
\par 
